      "asked_as": "1a1db65e-52d5-493b-a1a9-7e495005530a",
      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 26.18,
      "answer": "IVMS (In-Vehicle Monitoring System) is part of the vehicle telematics offerings within the NAVAS ecosystem. It provides core functionalities such as location tracking, trip history, and geofencing. Optional add-ons include driver behavior monitoring (ECO) and business intelligence dashboards. The system is designed to ensure stable tracking, compliance, and report readiness, with baseline alerts for overspeed, ignition on/off, and geofence in/out.\n\nSource: NAVAS CMS User Manual — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
