      "seconds": 20.72,
      "answer": "Tracking tokens in the NAVAS ecosystem are used to bill for GPS tracking based on time. Customers pay for tracking by the hour, day, or month, which allows them to only pay when their assets are active. This model supports pause and resume functions, enabling flexible billing aligned with asset usage.\n\nSource: NAVAS Token Billing Strategy — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
